{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "phase": "02-package-boundary-build-scaffolding",
  "note": "Phase 3 起 `.` 不再是空 barrel：它再导出内核（`lib/kernel/*`）与四个 port（`lib/ports/*`）；Phase 4 又让它汇总搬入的资源层（`lib/resources/*`，含 RES-02 的 `ResourceRegistry`）与编辑层（`lib/edit/*`）的全部公开名，故其 content 为 `kernel+resources+edit-exports`。`lib/resources`/`lib/edit` 是包内目录、不新增对外 subpath。`./react` 携带探针，是 Phase 2 的构建管线脚手架，Phase 4 起由真实 React 层替换；其余五个能力 shell（`./code`、`./table`、`./map`、`./asset`、`./shell`）仍是惰性空 barrel。",
  "subpaths": {
    ".": {
      "target": "./lib/index.ts",
      "content": "kernel+resources+edit-exports",
      "carriesProbe": false
    },
    "./code": {
      "target": "./lib/code/index.ts",
      "content": "empty-barrel",
      "carriesProbe": false
    },
    "./table": {
      "target": "./lib/table/index.ts",
      "content": "empty-barrel",
      "carriesProbe": false
    },
    "./map": {
      "target": "./lib/map/index.ts",
      "content": "empty-barrel",
      "carriesProbe": false
    },
    "./asset": {
      "target": "./lib/asset/index.ts",
      "content": "empty-barrel",
      "carriesProbe": false
    },
    "./shell": {
      "target": "./lib/shell/index.ts",
      "content": "empty-barrel",
      "carriesProbe": false
    },
    "./react": {
      "target": "./lib/react/index.ts",
      "content": "probe",
      "carriesProbe": true
    }
  }
}
